# BMAD paths (astra-app)

**Entry:** `_bmad-output/AGENTS.md`

| Action | File |
|--------|------|
| Epic AC | `_bmad-output/planning-artifacts/epics.md` only |
| Story status | `_bmad-output/implementation-artifacts/sprint-status.yaml` |
| New story context | `_bmad-output/implementation-artifacts/stories/` |
| Audit lookup | `_bmad-output/planning-artifacts/audits/manifest.yaml` |

Never treat `planning-artifacts/archive/**` or `implementation-artifacts/archive/**` as active sources.

Do not recreate `epics-refacto.md` / `epics-post-audit.md` / `epics-audits-2.md` at planning-artifacts root (breaks `*epic*.md` glob).
